    relevant: true,
    teaser:
      "Developed adversarial ML algorithms to test the robustness of government AI systems. Demonstrated that models are vulnerable to adversarial attacks, poisoning, and misalignment, establishing robustness as a prerequisite for safety.",
    summary:
      "Led security testing of internal AI systems for a government research project, using adversarial methods to identify and mitigate model vulnerabilities.",
    sections: [
      {
        heading: "Adversarial ML & Model Security",
        points: [
          "Developed adversarial ML algorithms to test the robustness of internal AI systems, surfacing concrete vulnerabilities to adversarial attacks and data poisoning.",
          "Demonstrated that models are vulnerable to adversarial attacks, poisoning, and misalignment, establishing that technical robustness is a necessary, not optional, component of AI safety.",
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
